    "title": "9 Pantry Ideas Under Stairs for Small Budgets and Rental Homes",
    "seoTitle": "9 Pantry Ideas Under Stairs on a Budget (Renter-Friendly)",
    "metaDescription": "Explore 9 pantry ideas under stairs, from stepped shelving to pull-out storage, with renter-friendly options. Measure first and keep utilities accessible.",
    "description": "Explore nine practical under-stairs pantry ideas for small budgets and rental homes, with measuring guidance and flexible storage options.",
    "image": "/images/blog/pantry-ideas-under-stairs/pantry-ideas-under-stairs-hero.webp",
    "imageAlt": "Pantry under stairs with stepped freestanding shelves, low bins, food containers, and discreet battery-powered lighting.",
    "authorImage": "/images/authors/carolina-wilson.webp",
    "datePublished": "2026-10-24",
